  _displayName: Recruitment Accepted
  _description: Aldric formally joins the Player's expedition after his quest is
    accepted.
  _speakerName: Sir Aldric
  _dialogueText: 'Then you have my sword, and my gratitude.

    I shall watch your
    back as you watch mine. Together, we will reach Gor''Vakh.

    Come. We have
    lingered in this prison long enough.'
